<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Hotel Radical Palace — Charbagh, Lucknow</title>
<meta name="description" content="Hotel Radical Palace, Charbagh, Lucknow — Nawabi hospitality steps from Lucknow Junction.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@500;600&family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,500;0,600;0,700;1,500;1,600&family=Karla:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --maroon-950:#2E0B16;
    --maroon-800:#5C1A2B;
    --maroon-700:#742238;
    --gold-500:#C9A227;
    --gold-300:#E6CB84;
    --gold-100:#F3E7C6;
    --cream-50:#F7EFE1;
    --cream-100:#F1E5CF;
    --ink-900:#26141A;
    --teal-800:#173234;
    --teal-700:#1F3F42;
    --line: rgba(201,162,39,0.35);
    --shadow: 0 24px 48px -24px rgba(46,11,22,0.45);
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    margin:0;
    background:var(--cream-50);
    color:var(--ink-900);
    font-family:'Karla',sans-serif;
    font-size:16px;
    line-height:1.6;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    html{scroll-behavior:auto;}
    *{animation-duration:0.001ms !important; transition-duration:0.001ms !important;}
  }
  h1,h2,h3,h4{
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;
    margin:0;
    font-weight:600;
    color:var(--maroon-950);
    letter-spacing:0.01em;
  }
  p{margin:0;}
  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;}
  img,svg{display:block;max-width:100%;}
  .eyebrow{
    font-family:'Cinzel',serif;
    font-weight:600;
    font-size:0.72rem;
    letter-spacing:0.28em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--gold-500);
  }
  .wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 28px;}
  section{position:relative;}
  .btn{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:10px;
    font-family:'Cinzel',serif;
    font-size:0.72rem;
    font-weight:600;
    letter-spacing:0.18em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    padding:16px 30px;
    border-radius:2px;
    cursor:pointer;
    border:1px solid transparent;
    transition:transform .35s ease, box-shadow .35s ease, background .35s ease, color .35s ease;
  }
  .btn-gold{
    background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--gold-300),var(--gold-500));
    color:var(--maroon-950);
    box-shadow:0 14px 30px -12px rgba(201,162,39,0.55);
  }
  .btn-gold:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 20px 36px -14px rgba(201,162,39,0.7);}
  .btn-line{
    background:transparent;
    color:var(--cream-50);
    border-color:rgba(247,239,225,0.55);
  }
  .btn-line:hover{background:rgba(247,239,225,0.1);border-color:var(--cream-50);}

  /* ---------- reveal on scroll ---------- */
  .reveal{opacity:0; transform:translateY(28px); transition:opacity .9s ease, transform .9s ease;}
  .reveal.in{opacity:1; transform:none;}

  /* ---------- nav ---------- */
  header{
    position:fixed; top:0; left:0; right:0; z-index:100;
    padding:20px 0;
    transition:background .4s ease, padding .4s ease, box-shadow .4s ease, border-color .4s ease;
    border-bottom:1px solid transparent;
  }
  header.solid{
    background:rgba(46,11,22,0.94);
    backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
    padding:12px 0;
    box-shadow:0 10px 30px -18px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
    border-color:var(--line);
  }
  nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;}
  .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;}
  .brand-mark{width:30px;height:34px;}
  .brand-name{
    font-family:'Cinzel',serif;
    font-size:0.98rem;
    letter-spacing:0.08em;
    color:var(--cream-50);
  }
  .brand-name span{display:block;font-size:0.58rem;letter-spacing:0.24em;color:var(--gold-300);margin-top:2px;}
  .nav-links{display:flex;gap:34px;list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;}
  .nav-links a{
    font-family:'Cinzel',serif;
    font-size:0.68rem;
    letter-spacing:0.16em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--cream-100);
    padding-bottom:4px;
    border-bottom:1px solid transparent;
    transition:border-color .3s ease, color .3s ease;
  }
  .nav-links a:hover{border-color:var(--gold-500); color:var(--gold-300);}
  .nav-cta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:22px;}
  .hamburger{display:none;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;padding:6px;}
  .hamburger span{width:24px;height:2px;background:var(--cream-50);}

  /* ---------- hero ---------- */
  .hero{
    min-height:100vh;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    padding:150px 0 90px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 18% 18%, rgba(201,162,39,0.16), transparent 42%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 82% 78%, rgba(201,162,39,0.12), transparent 45%),
      linear-gradient(180deg,var(--maroon-950) 0%, var(--maroon-800) 62%, #4A1424 100%);
    position:relative;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .hero::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute; inset:0;
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(circle, rgba(230,203,132,0.14) 1px, transparent 1.4px);
    background-size:26px 26px;
    opacity:0.35;
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  .hero-grid{
    position:relative; z-index:2;
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1.05fr 0.95fr;
    gap:60px;
    align-items:center;
  }
  .hero-copy .eyebrow{color:var(--gold-300);}
  .hero h1{
    font-size:clamp(2.7rem,5.2vw,4.4rem);
    line-height:1.04;
    color:var(--cream-50);
    margin-top:18px;
  }
  .hero h1 em{
    font-style:italic;
    color:var(--gold-300);
    font-weight:500;
  }
  .hero-sub{
    margin-top:22px;
    max-width:460px;
    color:rgba(247,239,225,0.82);
    font-size:1.02rem;
  }
  .hero-meta{
    display:flex; gap:28px; margin-top:32px; flex-wrap:wrap;
  }
  .hero-meta div{border-left:1px solid var(--line); padding-left:14px;}
  .hero-meta strong{display:block; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-size:1.5rem; color:var(--gold-300);}
  .hero-meta span{font-size:0.72rem; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:rgba(247,239,225,0.7);}
  .hero-cta{display:flex; gap:16px; margin-top:38px; flex-wrap:wrap;}

  .arch-frame{
    clip-path:url(#archClip);
    -webkit-clip-path:url(#archClip);
  }
  .hero-art{
    position:relative;
    aspect-ratio:3/4.1;
  }
  .hero-art .arch-frame{
    width:100%; height:100%;
    background:
      linear-gradient(155deg, rgba(230,203,132,0.28), transparent 55%),
      linear-gradient(200deg,var(--teal-800),#0F2426 70%);
    display:flex; align-items:flex-end; justify-content:center;
    padding-bottom:14%;
  }
  .hero-art .arch-inner-label{
    font-family:'Cinzel',serif;
    color:var(--gold-300);
    font-size:0.66rem;
    letter-spacing:0.3em;
    text-align:center;
    text-transform:uppercase;
  }
  .hero-art .jaali{
    position:absolute; inset:0;
    background-image:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(230,203,132,0.5) 1.3px, transparent 1.6px);
    background-size:20px 20px;
    clip-path:url(#archClip);
    -webkit-clip-path:url(#archClip);
    opacity:0.22;
  }
  .hero-art .ring{
    position:absolute; inset:-14px;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    clip-path:url(#archClipOuter);
    -webkit-clip-path:url(#archClipOuter);
  }

  /* ---------- section shells ---------- */
  .section{padding:120px 0;}
  .section-cream{background:var(--cream-50);}
  .section-panel{background:var(--cream-100);}
  .section-dark{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--teal-800),var(--teal-700)); color:var(--cream-50);}
  .section-dark h2, .section-dark h3{color:var(--cream-50);}
  .section-maroon{background:radial-gradient(circle at 80% 0%, rgba(201,162,39,0.14), transparent 55%), var(--maroon-950);}
  .section-maroon h2{color:var(--cream-50);}
  .head{max-width:640px; margin-bottom:56px;}
  .head h2{font-size:clamp(2.1rem,3.4vw,3rem); margin-top:14px;}
  .divider{
    width:64px; height:2px;
    background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--gold-500),transparent);
    margin:18px 0;
  }

  /* ---------- about ---------- */
  .about-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:0.85fr 1.15fr; gap:70px; align-items:center;}
  .about-art{aspect-ratio:4/5; position:relative;}
  .about-art .arch-frame{
    width:100%; height:100%;
    background:linear-gradient(160deg, var(--gold-100), var(--cream-100) 55%),
      repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(92,26,43,0.06) 0 2px, transparent 2px 22px);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
  }
  .about-art .badge{
    font-family:'Cinzel',serif; font-size:0.62rem; letter-spacing:0.22em; text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--maroon-800); text-align:center; padding:0 20%;
  }
  .about-copy p{margin-top:18px; color:#3E2530; max-width:520px;}
  .about-stats{display:flex; gap:38px; margin-top:38px; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .about-stats div{padding-top:14px; border-top:2px solid var(--gold-500);}
  .about-stats strong{display:block; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-size:2.1rem; color:var(--maroon-800);}
  .about-stats span{font-size:0.72rem; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#6B4A52; text-transform:uppercase;}

  /* ---------- rooms ---------- */
  .rooms-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:34px;}
  .room-card{
    background:var(--cream-50);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    display:flex; flex-direction:column;
  }
  .room-art{aspect-ratio:5/4; position:relative;}
  .room-art .arch-frame{
    width:100%; height:100%;
    display:flex; align-items:flex-end; justify-content:center; padding-bottom:12%;
  }
  .room-art .arch-inner-label{font-family:'Cinzel',serif; color:rgba(247,239,225,0.85); font-size:0.6rem; letter-spacing:0.24em; text-transform:uppercase;}
  .room-1 .arch-frame{background:linear-gradient(160deg,#6E2436,#3A0F1C);}
  .room-2 .arch-frame{background:linear-gradient(160deg,#1F3F42,#102526);}
  .room-3 .arch-frame{background:linear-gradient(160deg,#8A6A17,#4A3708);}
  .room-body{padding:28px 26px 30px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; flex:1;}
  .room-tier{font-family:'Cinzel',serif; font-size:0.62rem; letter-spacing:0.2em; color:var(--gold-500); text-transform:uppercase;}
  .room-body h3{font-size:1.55rem;}
  .room-price{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-size:1.6rem; color:var(--maroon-800);}
  .room-price span{font-family:'Karla',sans-serif; font-size:0.75rem; color:#6B4A52;}
  .room-list{list-style:none; margin:4px 0 0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px;}
  .room-list li{font-size:0.86rem; color:#4A2E37; display:flex; gap:8px; align-items:baseline;}
  .room-list li::before{content:"—"; color:var(--gold-500); flex-shrink:0;}
  .room-cta{margin-top:auto; padding-top:10px; font-family:'Cinzel',serif; font-size:0.66rem; letter-spacing:0.16em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--maroon-800); border-bottom:1px solid var(--maroon-800); align-self:flex-start; padding-bottom:3px;}

  /* ---------- amenities ---------- */
  .amenity-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:1px; background:var(--line); border:1px solid var(--line);}
  .amenity-cell{background:var(--cream-50); padding:40px 30px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:16px;}
  .amenity-cell svg{width:30px; height:30px; stroke:var(--maroon-800);}
  .amenity-cell h4{font-size:1.2rem;}
  .amenity-cell p{font-size:0.86rem; color:#5C3E46; margin-top:2px;}

  /* ---------- dining ---------- */
  .dine-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:70px; align-items:center;}
  .dine-art{aspect-ratio:4/5; position:relative;}
  .dine-art .arch-frame{
    width:100%; height:100%;
    background:linear-gradient(165deg, rgba(230,203,132,0.22), transparent 60%), radial-gradient(circle at 30% 20%, rgba(230,203,132,0.18), transparent 55%), #0F2426;
    border:1px solid rgba(230,203,132,0.35);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
  }
  .dine-art .badge{font-family:'Cinzel',serif; font-size:0.62rem; letter-spacing:0.24em; color:var(--gold-300); text-align:center; padding:0 18%;}
  .dine-rating{display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; margin-top:22px; font-family:'Cinzel',serif; font-size:0.78rem; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:var(--gold-300);}
  .dine-copy p{margin-top:18px; color:rgba(247,239,225,0.82); max-width:480px;}

  /* ---------- location ---------- */
  .loc-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr; gap:60px; align-items:start;}
  .loc-list{list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column;}
  .loc-list li{padding:22px 0; border-top:1px solid var(--line); display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:20px; align-items:baseline;}
  .loc-list li:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}
  .loc-name{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-size:1.2rem; color:var(--maroon-950);}
  .loc-dist{font-family:'Cinzel',serif; font-size:0.68rem; letter-spacing:0.1em; color:var(--gold-500); white-space:nowrap;}
  .loc-card{background:var(--maroon-950); color:var(--cream-50); padding:40px 34px; border:1px solid var(--line);}
  .loc-card h3{color:var(--cream-50); font-size:1.5rem;}
  .loc-card p{margin-top:14px; font-size:0.9rem; color:rgba(247,239,225,0.78);}
  .loc-card .row{display:flex; gap:12px; margin-top:16px; align-items:flex-start;}
  .loc-card .row svg{width:18px; height:18px; stroke:var(--gold-300); flex-shrink:0; margin-top:2px;}

  /* ---------- reviews ---------- */
  .review-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:30px;}
  .review-card{background:var(--cream-50); border:1px solid var(--line); padding:34px 30px;}
  .stars{color:var(--gold-500); font-size:0.9rem; letter-spacing:2px;}
  .review-card p.quote{margin-top:16px; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-style:italic; font-size:1.18rem; color:var(--ink-900);}
  .review-who{margin-top:20px; font-family:'Cinzel',serif; font-size:0.64rem; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#6B4A52;}

  /* ---------- cta band ---------- */
  .cta-band{
    background:linear-gradient(120deg,var(--maroon-800),var(--maroon-950));
    padding:80px 0;
    text-align:center;
  }
  .cta-band h2{color:var(--cream-50); font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);}
  .cta-band p{color:rgba(247,239,225,0.78); margin-top:14px;}
  .cta-band .btn-gold{margin-top:32px;}

  /* ---------- footer ---------- */
  footer{background:var(--maroon-950); color:rgba(247,239,225,0.72); padding:70px 0 30px;}
  .foot-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr 1fr; gap:50px;}
  .foot-brand .brand-name{color:var(--cream-50);}
  .foot-brand p{margin-top:16px; font-size:0.88rem; max-width:320px;}
  footer h4{color:var(--gold-300); font-family:'Cinzel',serif; font-size:0.7rem; letter-spacing:0.16em; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:18px;}
  footer ul{list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px; font-size:0.9rem;}
  .foot-bottom{margin-top:60px; padding-top:24px; border-top:1px solid rgba(247,239,225,0.14); display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-size:0.76rem; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px;}

  /* ---------- toast ---------- */
  .toast{
    position:fixed; left:50%; bottom:34px; transform:translate(-50%,140%);
    background:var(--maroon-950); color:var(--cream-50); border:1px solid var(--gold-500);
    padding:16px 26px; font-size:0.88rem; z-index:200; transition:transform .5s ease;
    box-shadow:0 20px 40px -14px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
  }
  .toast.show{transform:translate(-50%,0);}

  /* ---------- responsive ---------- */
  @media (max-width:980px){
    .hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr; text-align:left;}
    .hero-art{max-width:340px; margin-top:20px;}
    .about-grid, .dine-grid, .loc-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .rooms-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}
    .amenity-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}
    .review-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .foot-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}
  }
  @media (max-width:760px){
    .nav-links{
      position:fixed; top:0; right:0; height:100vh; width:76%;
      background:var(--maroon-950); flex-direction:column; padding:110px 34px;
      transform:translateX(100%); transition:transform .4s ease; gap:26px;
      border-left:1px solid var(--line);
    }
    .nav-links.open{transform:translateX(0);}
    .hamburger{display:flex;}
    .nav-cta .btn-line{display:none;}
    .rooms-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .amenity-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .foot-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .section{padding:84px 0;}
    .hero{padding-top:130px;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<svg width="0" height="0" style="position:absolute">
  <defs>
    <clipPath id="archClip" clipPathUnits="objectBoundingBox">
      <path d="M0,1 L0,0.46 C0,0.24 0.15,0.045 0.5,0 C0.85,0.045 1,0.24 1,0.46 L1,1 Z"/>
    </clipPath>
    <clipPath id="archClipOuter" clipPathUnits="objectBoundingBox">
      <path d="M0,1 L0,0.46 C0,0.235 0.148,0.04 0.5,-0.006 C0.852,0.04 1,0.235 1,0.46 L1,1 Z"/>
    </clipPath>
  </defs>
</svg>

<header id="siteHeader">
  <div class="wrap">
    <nav>
      <a href="#top" class="brand">
        <svg class="brand-mark" viewBox="0 0 30 34" fill="none"><path d="M1 33V15.6C1 8.7 7.2 1 15 1C22.8 1 29 8.7 29 15.6V33" stroke="#E6CB84" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M6 33V17.4C6 12.6 10 7 15 7C20 7 24 12.6 24 17.4V33" stroke="#C9A227" stroke-width="1.4"/></svg>
        <span class="brand-name">Hotel Radical Palace<span>Charbagh · Lucknow</span></span>
      </a>
      <ul class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
        <li><a href="#about">Welcome</a></li>
        <li><a href="#rooms">Rooms</a></li>
        <li><a href="#dining">Dining</a></li>
        <li><a href="#amenities">Amenities</a></li>
        <li><a href="#location">Location</a></li>
        <li><a href="#reviews">Reviews</a></li>
      </ul>
      <div class="nav-cta">
        <a href="tel:+917607999872" class="btn btn-line">076079 99872</a>
        <button class="hamburger" id="hamburger" aria-label="Menu"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Aishbagh Road · Naka Hindola · Lucknow</p>
      <h1>Nawabi warmth,<br><em>Pehle Aap</em> hospitality.</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">A palace-inspired stay in the heart of Charbagh — eight minutes from Lucknow Junction, and a short drive from the city's grand Imambaras and bazaars.</p>
      <div class="hero-meta">
        <div><strong>4.2 / 5</strong><span>2,300+ Google reviews</span></div>
        <div><strong>8 min</strong><span>Walk to Lucknow Junction</span></div>
        <div><strong>4 km</strong><span>To Bara Imambara</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a href="#book" class="btn btn-gold">Check Availability</a>
        <a href="#rooms" class="btn btn-line">View Rooms</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-art">
      <div class="ring"></div>
      <div class="arch-frame">
        <div class="jaali"></div>
        <p class="arch-inner-label">Est. hospitality<br>on Aishbagh Road</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-cream" id="book">
  <div class="wrap reveal">
    <div class="loc-card" style="max-width:100%; display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr auto; gap:26px; align-items:end; background:var(--maroon-950);">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--gold-300)">Check-in</p>
        <input type="date" style="margin-top:10px;width:100%;background:transparent;border:none;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--cream-50);font-family:'Karla',sans-serif;padding:8px 0;font-size:0.95rem;">
      </div>
